@bank all
// Head writer W (playtest 1, O5): Day 0 tips with a "Track it" button. TEXTS.
// tip.callhome: right after Calder's table visit on the arrival evening. .button: the button. .goal: the arrow's label.

== tip.callhome
- Call home tonight. The call booths are on Deck 3. Tell them you arrived safely.
== tip.callhome.button
- Track it
== tip.callhome.goal
- Call home from the booths

// ---- Playtest 2 (head writer W2): green tips (seat U). Each shows once per save.
// item 9: once, on the training day; the patch (#13): once, while a long job's bar fills, any day of the first week
== tip.device
- While a long job's bar fills, you can open your device: check your Schedule, Mail or Schedule tracker. The work carries on.
// item 19: at the start of Day 2 (you arrive with one spare); the 0.99.5 patch (#1): laundry in general, no weekday (your
// laundry day moves once your full kit's in)
== tip.laundry.day2
- Clean clothes come from your wardrobe. When they run out, take your hamper to the laundry on Deck 4: load a washer, and come back when it's done.
// the patch (#28): the same tip, any time on Day 2 you're up and not clocked in. Up late, the shift already on:
== tip.laundry.day2.late
- Laundry's for after your shift. Clock in first; the washers will wait.
// after the shift (17:00 on):
== tip.laundry.day2.after
- Your hamper's in your wardrobe in Bunk 1. The laundry's on Deck 4, past the washrooms.
